<F_R_OG_MASH_MEASURED_SET>0</F_R_OG_MASH_MEASURED_SET>
<F_R_NOTES>Modern hoppy Japanese-style rice lager based on the July/August 2022 Zymurgy recipe. This version uses a 90 C (194 F) 10-minute whirlpool steep. Mash 70 min at 64 C with mash pH 5.2-5.5. Sparge at 75-78 C if sparging. For Imperial L55 Kanpai, ferment at 12-14 C (54-58 F). The original recipe starts at 10 C and increases 1 C per day, but L55 is published for 12-14 C and is sensitive to pitch rate, temperature, and dissolved oxygen. Add dry hops when SG is below 1.015. After 3 days with no gravity change, cold crash near 0 C and lager 1-2 weeks. Carbonate to 2.4 volumes CO2. Water target: Ca 50 ppm, Mg &lt;10, Na &lt;10, SO4 60, Cl 40, HCO3 &lt;10. Vic Secret alpha acid was not specified in the source recipe; this file uses 16.0% as a placeholder. Adjust hop alpha acids to match your packages before brewing. Yeast switched to Imperial Yeast L55 Kanpai. Misc/extras use Grainfather-friendly DISPLAY_AMOUNT formatting based on a working import sample.</F_R_NOTES>
